%T A172562 452489654840076972518400,712008996110160366168717566400,
%U A172562 2343976695927269878444049332219968000
%N A172562 Number of 3*n X n 0..1 arrays with row sums 2 and column sums 6.
%D A172562 Gao, Shanzhen, and Matheis, Kenneth, Closed formulas and integer sequences arising from the enumeration of (0,1)-matrices with row sum two and some constant column sums. In Proceedings of the Forty-First Southeastern International Conference on Combinatorics, Graph Theory and Computing. Congr. Numer. 202 (2010), 45-53.
%H A172562 Vaclav Kotesovec, <a href="/A172562/b172562.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..97</a> (terms 1..33 from R. H. Hardin)
%F A172562 a(n) = ((3*n)!*n!/48^n) * Sum_{r0=0..n, r1=0..n-r0, r2=0..n-r0-r1} (-1)^(n+r0+r2) * 3^r2 * (6*r0 + 4*r1 + 2*r2)! / (r0!*r1!*r2! * (n - r0 - r1 - r2)! * (3*r0 + 2*r1 + r2)! * 120^r0 * 4^r1 * 2^r2). - _Shanzhen Gao_, Feb 16 2010, updated Oct 12 2026
%F A172562 a(n) ~ sqrt(Pi) * 3^(4*n + 1/2) * n^(6*n + 1/2) / (2^(n-1) * 5^n * exp(6*n + 5/2)). - _Vaclav Kotesovec_, Oct 12 2026
%t A172562 Table[(3*n)!*n!/48^n * Sum[Sum[Sum[(-1)^(n + r0 + r2) * 3^r2 * (6*r0 + 4*r1 + 2*r2)! / (r0! * r1! * r2! * (n - r0 - r1 - r2)! * (3*r0 + 2*r1 + r2)! * 120^r0 * 4^r1 * 2^r2), {r2, 0, n - r0 - r1}], {r1, 0, n - r0}], {r0, 0, n}], {n, 1, 12}] (* _Vaclav Kotesovec_, Oct 12 2026, after _Shanzhen Gao_ *)
%K A172562 nonn,changed
%O A172562 1,3
%A A172562 _R. H. Hardin_, Feb 06 2010
